# NextStep source surveillance — OS cron template (STEP 14).
# Install: copy this line into the deployment user's crontab (crontab -e),
# replacing /srv/nextstep with the real checkout path. Runs daily at 02:00,
# checks up to 5 candidates, records staging state. Bounded by the CLI's own
# --limit handling; overlapping ticks refuse via the runExclusive() lock.
# Dry-run alternative (report only, zero writes):
#   0 2 * * * /usr/bin/node /srv/nextstep/scraper/cli/surveillance.js --limit 5 --dry-run
0 2 * * * /usr/bin/node /srv/nextstep/scraper/cli/surveillance.js --limit 5 --persist
